[t13] Safety Auditor: I'll review the email to make sure it includes the expected downtime for the API, so the team knows what to expect and can plan accordingly.

[t14] Operations Lead: I'll add a note to the email about the expected downtime, which is about 30 minutes, and also mention that we'll be monitoring the situation closely to minimize any further impact. I'll also make sure to update the incident page with the latest information.

